      hu: ["A várost kellemes klímája miatt a nyár fővárosaként is emlegetik.", "Bejrúttól 17 km-re keletre, 800-900 méteres magasságban fekszik.", "Számos 19. századi oszmán kori kővilla található a településen.", "A lakosság jelentős része a drúz vallási közösséghez tartozik.", "Gazdaságának motorja a Perzsa-öbölből érkező nyári turizmus."],
      ro: ["Datorită climei sale plăcute, orașul este numit capitala verii.", "Se află la 17 km est de Beirut, la o altitudine de 800-900 de metri.", "Așezarea găzduiește numeroase vile otomane din piatră (secolul XIX).", "O proporție semnificativă a populației aparține comunității religioase druze.", "Economia este stimulată de turiștii de vară din țările Golfului Persic."],
      en: ["Because of its pleasant climate, the city is known as the Capital of the Summer.", "It is situated 17 km east of Beirut at an altitude of 800-900 meters.", "The settlement features numerous 19th-century Ottoman stone villas.", "A significant portion of the population belongs to the Druze religious community.", "The economy is heavily driven by summer tourists from the Persian Gulf."]
