      hu: "Város a Bekaa-völgyben, amely történelmileg nagy vasútállomásáról volt ismert.",
      ro: "Un oraș în Valea Bekaa, cunoscut istoric pentru marea sa gară.",
      en: "A town in the Beqaa Valley, historically known for its large railway station."
